---
layout: base.njk
title: The NAVO Blog
description: Real stories, plain-English guides, and honest conversations about navigating aged care for your parents.
---
<style>
.hero {
  background: var(--navy);
  padding: calc(var(--nav-h) + 5rem) 2rem 5rem;
  text-align: center; position: relative; overflow: hidden;
}
.hero-glow {
  position: absolute; top: 0; left: 50%;
  transform: translateX(-50%);
  width: 700px; height: 400px; pointer-events: none;
  background: radial-gradient(ellipse at 50% 0%, rgba(200,97,74,0.08) 0%, transparent 65%);
}
.hero-inner { max-width: 760px; margin: 0 auto; position: relative; z-index: 1; }
.hero-label {
  font-size: 0.68rem; font-weight: 600;
  letter-spacing: 0.2em; text-transform: uppercase;
  color: var(--salmon); margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
}
.hero-h {
  font-size: clamp(2.4rem, 6vw, 4.5rem);
  font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: -0.03em;
  color: var(--white); line-height: 1.05; margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
}
.hero-sub {
  font-size: 1rem; line-height: 1.8; color: var(--muted);
  max-width: 480px; margin: 0 auto;
}
.posts-section {
  background: var(--linen); padding: 6rem 2rem; color: var(--ink);
}
.posts-inner { max-width: 1040px; margin: 0 auto; }
.posts-label {
  font-size: 0.68rem; font-weight: 600;
  letter-spacing: 0.2em; text-transform: uppercase;
  color: var(--salmon); margin-bottom: 3rem;
}
.posts-grid {
  display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3,1fr); gap: 2rem;
}
.post-card {
  background: white; border-radius: 12px;
  overflow: hidden;
  box-shadow: 0 2px 12px rgba(14,26,43,0.06);
  transition: transform 0.3s, box-shadow 0.3s;
  display: flex; flex-direction: column;
  position: relative;
}
.post-card:hover { transform: translateY(-5px); box-shadow: 0 18px 48px rgba(14,26,43,0.12); }
.post-card::after {
  content: ''; position: absolute; bottom: 0; left: 0; right: 0; height: 3px;
  background: var(--salmon); transform: scaleX(0); transform-origin: left;
  transition: transform 0.35s;
}
.post-card:hover::after { transform: scaleX(1); }
.post-card-img {
  width: 100%; aspect-ratio: 16/9; object-fit: cover;
  background: var(--navy);
}
.post-card-img-placeholder {
  width: 100%; aspect-ratio: 16/9;
  background: linear-gradient(135deg, #0e1a2b 0%, #1a2f4a 100%);
  display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
}
.post-card-img-placeholder span {
  font-size: 0.62rem; font-weight: 600;
  letter-spacing: 0.12em; text-transform: uppercase;
  color: rgba(255,255,255,0.15);
}
.post-card-body { padding: 1.75rem; flex: 1; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 0.75rem; }
.post-tag {
  font-size: 0.68rem; font-weight: 600;
  letter-spacing: 0.14em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--salmon);
}
.post-card-title {
  font-size: 1.05rem; font-weight: 700;
  letter-spacing: -0.01em; color: var(--ink); line-height: 1.3;
}
.post-card-excerpt { font-size: 0.87rem; color: rgba(14,26,43,0.55); line-height: 1.7; flex: 1; }
.post-card-meta { font-size: 0.72rem; color: rgba(14,26,43,0.4); }
.post-card-link {
  display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.4rem;
  font-size: 0.82rem; font-weight: 600; color: var(--salmon);
  text-decoration: none; transition: gap 0.2s; margin-top: 0.5rem;
}
.post-card-link:hover { gap: 0.65rem; }
.cta-strip {
  background: var(--navy); padding: 5rem 2rem; text-align: center;
}
.cta-strip-inner { max-width: 560px; margin: 0 auto; }
.cta-strip h2 {
  font-size: clamp(1.5rem, 3vw, 2.2rem); font-weight: 700;
  letter-spacing: -0.025em; color: var(--white); line-height: 1.15; margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
}
.cta-strip p { font-size: 0.92rem; color: var(--muted); line-height: 1.75; margin-bottom: 2rem; }
.cta-actions { display: flex; justify-content: center; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 0.85rem; }
@media (max-width: 760px) { .posts-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } }
</style>

<section class="hero">
  <div class="hero-glow"></div>
  <div class="hero-inner">
    <div class="hero-label">The NAVO Blog</div>
    <h1 class="hero-h">Real stories.<br>Plain-English guides.</h1>
    <p class="hero-sub">Honest conversations about what navigating aged care for your parents actually looks like. No overwhelm – just clarity.</p>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="posts-section">
  <div class="posts-inner">
    <div class="posts-label">Latest posts</div>
    {% if collections.posts.length %}
    <div class="posts-grid">
      {% for post in collections.posts | reverse %}
      <article class="post-card">
        {% if post.data.image %}
        <img src="{{ post.data.image }}" alt="{{ post.data.title }}" class="post-card-img">
        {% else %}
        <div class="post-card-img-placeholder"><span>NAVO Blog</span></div>
        {% endif %}
        <div class="post-card-body">
          {% if post.data.tags %}
          <span class="post-tag">{{ post.data.tags[0] }}</span>
          {% endif %}
          <h2 class="post-card-title">{{ post.data.title }}</h2>
          <p class="post-card-excerpt">{{ post.data.description }}</p>
          <div class="post-card-meta">{{ post.data.date | dateDisplay }} &nbsp;·&nbsp; {{ post.content | readTime }}</div>
          <a href="{{ post.url }}" class="post-card-link">Read more →</a>
        </div>
      </article>
      {% endfor %}
    </div>
    {% else %}
    <div style="text-align:center; padding: 4rem 0;">
      <h3 style="font-size:1.2rem; font-weight:700; color:var(--ink); margin-bottom:0.75rem;">First post coming soon.</h3>
      <p style="font-size:0.92rem; color:rgba(14,26,43,0.55); line-height:1.75;">Check back shortly – or stay connected and we'll let you know when new guides and stories are live.</p>
    </div>
    {% endif %}
  </div>
</section>

<section class="cta-strip">
  <div class="cta-strip-inner">
    <h2>Not sure where to start?</h2>
    <p>Take the free 15-minute check-in and see exactly what you know, what's missing, and where to begin.</p>
    <div class="cta-actions">
      <a href="https://tally.so/r/gDN0BP" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="btn btn-s">Start the free check-in →</a>
      <a href="https://shop.meetnavo.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="btn btn-gw">See the guides</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
